# A program runs in the folder pad was started in, whichever folder its source is in:
# this one is in sub/ and reads data.txt, which is beside where pad started.
# files data.txt=the data\n
# files sub/p.cm=class Main from IO\n  def main:\n    File f = new File()\n    f.open("data.txt", "r")\n    out(f.readLine() + "\\n")\n    f.close()\n  end\nend\n
# open sub/p.cm
# args --catmintc @ROOT@/catmintc
# frames 4
# expect panelall the data|[finished]
1 key f5
2 wait idle
